1
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:12,160
There was an earthquake in Highfield in 2021 and Timmy survived.

2
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:16,180
Sandy is reading his story.

3
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:24,130
The Highfield Earthquake It was about two o'clock in the afternoon.

4
00:00:24,130 --> 00:00:27,800
I was working when the earthquake started.

5
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:35,240
At first I felt a slight shake, then I heard a loud noise like thunder.

6
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:40,270
Soon the real noise came like bombs under the ground.

7
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:42,900
The earth started to shake.

8
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:45,270
People shouted in fear.

9
00:00:45,270 --> 00:00:47,590
Some ran out of the building.

10
00:00:47,590 --> 00:00:50,870
I tried my best to run out too.

11
00:00:50,870 --> 00:00:58,860
Outside people were running in all directions while pieces of glass and bricks were raining down.

12
00:00:58,860 --> 00:01:02,250
Then the walls began to come down too.

13
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:06,170
Finally the noise and shaking ended.

14
00:01:06,170 --> 00:01:09,400
It was dark and silent around me.

15
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:11,900
I couldn't see anything at all.

16
00:01:11,900 --> 00:01:15,430
I didn't know if anyone else was around me.

17
00:01:15,430 --> 00:01:20,590
I felt nervous and my heart was beating really fast.

18
00:01:20,590 --> 00:01:24,040
I'm trapped, I said to myself.

19
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:32,160
A moment of fear went through my mind, but I told myself to calm down since I was still alive.

20
00:01:32,160 --> 00:01:34,540
I shouted for help.

21
00:01:34,540 --> 00:01:40,360
I thought somebody could hear me, but no one came for a very long time.

22
00:01:40,360 --> 00:01:44,710
I knew I had to save energy and wait for help.

23
00:01:44,710 --> 00:01:55,370
Hours later, as I was trying to find my way out, I suddenly heard some noise above me. Help! Please help! I'm here!

24
00:01:55,370 --> 00:01:57,840
I cried out in a weak voice.

25
00:01:57,840 --> 00:02:01,400
Then I heard shouts from excited people.

26
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:04,070
They quickly moved away the bricks.

27
00:02:04,070 --> 00:02:06,420
At last, I was safe.
